  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sum-difference-product",
      "title": "Multiply the sum and difference",
      "explanation": "The given difference and the requested sum are the two factors in the identity \\((a-b)(a+b)=a^2-b^2\\).\n\nLet \\(S\\) be the requested sum. Multiplying it by the given difference gives\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n3S\n&=\\left(\\sqrt{49-x^2}-\\sqrt{25-x^2}\\right)\n\\left(\\sqrt{49-x^2}+\\sqrt{25-x^2}\\right)\\\\\n&=(49-x^2)-(25-x^2)\\\\\n&=24.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\nThus \\(S=24/3=\\boxed{8}\\), choice A.",
      "directNodeIds": [
        "cnm_147",
        "cnm_168"
      ],
